{'symbol': 'AIZ', 'date': '2023-05-02 16:15:00', 'title': 'ASSURANT REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2023 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ASSURANT, INC. (NYSE: AIZ), A LEADING GLOBAL BUSINESS SERVICES COMPANY THAT SUPPORTS, PROTECTS AND CONNECTS MAJOR CONSUMER PURCHASES, TODAY REPORTED RESULTS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2023. “WE ARE PLEASED BY OUR FIRST QUARTER RESULTS, WHICH REFLECTED STRONGER THAN EXPECTED PERFORMANCE IN GLOBAL HOUSING BUILDING ON PROGRESS IN FOURTH QUARTER 2022. WHILE DOWN YEAR-OVER-YEAR, GLOBAL LIFESTYLE'S RESULTS WERE IN-LINE WITH OUR EXPECTATIONS AND IMPROVED SEQUENTIAL."}